<title>USA: Sudamtex de Venezuela Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Sudamtex de Venezuela Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended March 31,</p>
<p>			    1997			 1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $6.07		    $5.61</p>
<p> Net		    7,246,640		6,691,128</p>
<p> Sales		 48,717,833	     58,372,739</p>
<p> Avg Shrs		1,193,076	     1,193,076</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above in 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company's full name is Sudamtex de Venezuela C.A., S.A.C.A., of Caracas.</p>
<p>All figures, except per share numbers, are stated in Bolivars as of March 31, 1997, at an exchange rate of Bs 478 to US$.</p>
<p>For the nine months ended March 31, 1997, the company reported net sales, adjusted for inflation, of Bs 48.7 billion compared with Bs 58.3 billion for the same period last year. Net income reached Bs 7.2 billion for the nine months ended March 1997, an 8.3 percent increase over 1996.</p>
</text>
